# A new game from the menus at the default skill: E1M1, standing still
# for 10 seconds, then the walk to the first door (linedefs 151 and 152
# of E1M1, at x 1536-1552, y -2560 to -2432): strafe right past the
# pillar of the central platform and the barrel at (1312, -3264), walk
# north up the corridor (it slides the player east along its north wall
# to about (1470, -2455)), turn right to face the door, fire at it, open
# it and walk through. The notes "still" and "still-10s" bound the
# measure of the frame rate standing still.
#
# The menus are followed by their state, so that the keys come when the
# game is ready for them at any CPU rate. Times in the level are game
# tics (Nt), which keep the moves about the same at any rate; the
# stand-still time is machine time (Ns). The level loads in 3 s at
# 12 MHz, 12 s at 2.86 MHz.

wait d_main65.s:pagedrawn == 1 within 90s   # the title page is up
at +1s press escape                     # the main menu (0), at NEW GAME
wait _g_menuactive == 1 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 0 within 1
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 0 within 1
at +3s shot menu                        # (drawn by then at 2.86 MHz)
press return                            # the skill menu (2), at the
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 2 within 10s   # default skill
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 2 within 1
at +3s shot skill
press return                            # HURT ME PLENTY: E1M1 loads
wait _g_usergame == 1 within 10s
wait _g_gamestate == 0 within 10s       # GS_LEVEL
wait long _g_gametic grows 1 within 60s # the first tic after the load
wait _g_gamemap == 1 within 1           # E1M1,
wait _g_gameskill == 2 within 1         # at skill 2 (sk_medium)
at +3s note still                       # the level's screen is up
shot still-00s
at +5s shot still-05s
at +5s shot still-10s
note still-10s

key down d                              # strafe right
at +34t key up d
key down up                             # walk north
at +50t key down d
at +8t key up d
at +50t shot walk
at +50t key up up
at +5t key down right                   # face east, at the door
at +36t key up right
shot turned
at +5t key down control                 # fire
at +20t key up control
at +5t shot fire
at +10t press space                     # open the door
at +35t shot door-opening
at +35t shot door-open
key down up                             # through it
at +35t key up up
shot through
at +10t stop
